refentry.refsect1:
  &reftitle.description;

   boolin_array
   mixedneedle
   arrayhaystack
   boolstrict&false;


strict set नगरिएसम्म, loose comparison प्रयोग गरेर haystack मा needle खोज्दछ।

  &reftitle.examples;



    in_array को उदाहरण


<?php
$os = array("Mac", "NT", "Irix", "Linux");
if (in_array("Irix", $os)) {
    echo "Got Irix";
}
if (in_array("mac", $os)) {
    echo "Got mac";
}
?>



दोस्रो condition असफल हुन्छ किनभने in_array case-sensitive हो, त्यसैले माथिको program ले प्रदर्शन गर्नेछ:


Got Irix







    strict सहितको in_array को उदाहरण


<?php
$a = array('1.10', 12.4, 1.13);

if (in_array('12.4', $a, true)) {
    echo "'12.4' found with strict check\n";
}

if (in_array(1.13, $a, true)) {
    echo "1.13 found with strict check\n";
}
?>


    &example.outputs;


1.13 found with strict check







    needle को रूपमा एउटा array भएको in_array


<?php
$a = array(array('p', 'h'), array('p', 'r'), 'o');

if (in_array(array('p', 'h'), $a)) {
    echo "'ph' was found\n";
}

if (in_array(array('f', 'i'), $a)) {
    echo "'fi' was found\n";
}

if (in_array('o', $a)) {
    echo "'o' was found\n";
}
?>


    &example.outputs;


'ph' was found
'o' was found
